{
  "schema": "fcb.design-plan/1",
  "spec_id": "g3-dev-020-twin-boss-block",
  "spec_text": "A spacer block 80 mm by 30 mm and 10 mm thick carrying two cylindrical bosses on its top face. Each boss is 14 mm in diameter and 12 mm tall, and their axes are 50 mm apart, symmetric about the block centre. A 6 mm hole runs through each boss and the block beneath it.",
