  "approved": true,
  "approved_by": "designer-actor",
  "rationale": "The boss profile is on the same XY plane as the block outline, so padding it 22 mm (10 mm block + 12 mm boss) leaves each boss standing 12 mm proud of the top face. The 6 mm holes are then drilled ThroughAll so each passes through its boss and the block."
